{"id": 10495, "name": "San Juan County Fairgrounds", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.sanjuancountywa.gov/2186/San-Juan-County-Fairgrounds", "lines": ["mpsite locations, and facility rental locations. | | Fairground RV Campsites | Located less than a mile from downtown Friday Harbor, the San Juan County Fairgrounds offers eight RV camping pedestals. The nightly rate is $50 per site. Cost includes up to five people and one towed vehicle/vessel/trailer. Extra people (5+ years old), up to 8 maximum, are charged $8 per night. Extra non-towed vehicle, two maximum, is $15", "uan County Fairgrounds offers eight RV camping pedestals. The nightly rate is $50 per site. Cost includes up to five people and one towed vehicle/vessel/trailer. Extra people (5+ years old), up to 8 maximum, are charged $8 per night. Extra non-towed vehicle, two maximum, is $15.00 per night. Each pedestal is equipped with water and power hook-ups, 20/30 AMP. Sewage hookup not included in the site fee. Restrooms, incl", "se call the Parks & Fairgrounds Administrative Office for more information at (360) 378-8420. | Fairground Group Camping | Fairgrounds group camping is the only tent camping available. Our grassy, forested group camp is $180 per night for up to 50 people. Extra people (5+ years old), up to 100 maximum, are charged $8 per night. Amenities include vault toilets, an outdoor sink/water spigot, picnic tables, large fire p"]}, {"url": "https://www.sanjuancountywa.gov/2184/San-Juan-County-Park-Campground", "lines": [], "via": "San Juan County Park & Campground"}, {"url": "https://www.sanjuancountywa.gov/466/Camping-Information", "lines": [], "via": "Camping"}]}
